      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW WONDER (1) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 5.5 lengths away in third (24.46) at Bendigo in a Grade 5 over 425m. Likely to feature again. MIDNIGHT JED (5) was below best at his last start when 8th at Bendigo following a third place finish (28.59) there two back. Hard to go past form here at this journey. Has the ability to give this a shake. MOOKAITE (4) was in the placings last time but prior to that he produced a blistering 19.24 win over 350m at Healesville. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. SHEIKH OF TWEAK (2) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
